<title>USA: US EPA says Phoenix, Ariz., adopts RFG program.</title>
<headline>US EPA says Phoenix, Ariz., adopts RFG program.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Environmental Protection Agency said Tuesday it signed a final regulation to add Phoenix, Arizona, to the list of areas operating a reformulated gasoline program.</p>
<p>RFG will be available at local retail stations at the beginning of the 1997 ozone season, the EPA said.</p>
<p>Areas in 17 states and the District of Columbia currently participate in the program.</p>
</text>
